      "comment": "Sedene: Palais Mermonia",
      "content": "The Palais Mermonia is the main administrative building in Fontaine, at the highest point of the Court of Fontaine. Neuvillette's office is there, along with the Maison Gardiennage and the Marechaussee Phantom; Furina's former residence is on the top floor. Sedene sits at the desk, warns visitors that some rooms are restricted and notes that anyone with ill intent would not get far.",
