      ],
      "comment": "Sedene: Furina's former apartment",
      "content": "Before Masquerade of the Guilty, Sedene says Furina lives on the top floor with a private entrance and no free time slots. She mentions a man who tried to enter by jumping off the roof and is now working in the Fortress of Meropide. After the Archon Quest she says the apartment is a former one, because Furina left her official post to pursue a life closer to her desires.",
