      "comment": "Sedene: Cake and coffee at Hotel Debord",
      "content": "In Hunters, Prophets, Paimon meets Sedene at Hotel Debord, where she says she has cake and coffee most days. Asked what she would do if the city were flooded, she says she would carry on her routine. She buys two extra slices for the sad Traveler and Paimon, saying Sigewinne taught Melusines that food lifts human spirits.",
