      "key": [
        "Merusea Village gifts",
        "Neuvillette's gifts"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Sedene",
        "Melusine"
      ],
      "comment": "Sedene: Neuvillette: Gift",
      "content": "In a limited-time Travelers' Tales anecdote (5.7), Sedene advises Neuvillette on gifts for the Melusines of Merusea Village: clothes from Chioriya Boutique, clockwork parts, and food such as cake, macarons, profiteroles, pate de fruit and snacks. Neuvillette decides to give a gift to every Melusine, including her, and she mentions Serene's letters and Mamere's love of art.",
